<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000000DAV01FX" category="T" type-id="3001H" name-id="261HO-01" from="200912">
<name>List by Symptom</name>
<subpara id="RM000000DAV01FX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IPU00000">
<content5 releasenbr="2">
<atten3>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs; if the problem symptom occurs with normal DTC output (no DTCs stored), inspect each part according to the list below.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the ATF temperature is 0°C or less, shifting to 5 and 6 is not possible.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Lock-up is prohibited when the engine coolant temperature is 60°C or less, the stop light switch is ON, or the throttle is fully closed.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Acceleration flex lock-up control is not performed when the ATF temperature is 40°C or less or 110°C or higher, or when the stop light switch is ON.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Deceleration flex lock-up control is not performed when the ATF temperature is 20°C or less or 110°C or higher, or when the engine coolant temperature is 70°C or less.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
